# off-topic: the bot as people meet it on the website, its system prompt and information sheet from the
# arm's bundle (bot/). The request goes in as it was sent.
# model before provider: nb builds the provider's client as soon as it reads `provider`.
model {{model}}
provider {{provider}}
harness {{harness}}
tools none
system @{{bundle}}/system.md
system @{{bundle}}/knowledge.md
run {{prompt}}
